" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">－（－<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r89.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">）｜<br>＝｜－（<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r90.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r91.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r92.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">）｜<br>＝｜<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r93.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r94.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r95.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">｜<br>故選(Ｃ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910232","s":"已知△ABC　與△DEF　全等，A、B、C　的對應點分別為　D、E、F，且　E　點在　<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r96.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">　上，B、F、C、D　四點共線，如圖所示。若∠A＝40°，∠CED＝35°，則下列敘述何者正確？〔110.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image10.png\" width=\"129\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r98.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r99.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r100.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r101.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r102.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r103.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r104.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r105.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r106.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r107.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r108.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r109.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r110.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r111.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r112.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r113.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":1,"e":"由△ABC<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r114.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">△DEF，A、B、C　的對應點分別為　D、E、F　可知：<br>(１)∠EFD＝∠BCA（對應角相等）<br>即∠EFC＝∠ECF<br>∴<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r115.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r116.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">（等角對等邊）<br>(２)∠D＝∠A＝40°（對應角相等）<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r117.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r118.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">（對應邊等長）<br>又在△CDE　中，由∠D＝40°，∠CED＝35°<br>可知∠D＞∠CED<br>∴<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r119.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r120.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">（大角對大邊）<br>因此，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r121.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r122.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r123.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r124.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r125.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r126.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r127.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r128.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ｂ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910233","s":"如圖為某超商促銷活動的內容，今阿賢到該超商拿相差　4　元的　2　種飯糰各　1　個結帳時，店員說：「要不要多買　2　瓶指定飲料？搭配促銷活動後　2　組優惠價的金額，只比你買　2　個飯糰的金額多　30　元。」若阿賢只多買　1　瓶指定飲料，且店員會以對消費者最便宜的方式結帳，則與原本只買　2　個飯糰相比，他要多付多少元？〔110.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image11.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"171\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["12","13","15","16"],"a":1,"e":"設飯糰分別為　x　元及（x＋4）元<br>x＋（x＋4）＋30＝39×2<br>2x＋34＝78<br>x＝22<br>∴原本要付　22＋（22＋4）＝48<br>又多買　1　瓶指定飲料要付　39＋22＝61<br>可知阿賢多付　61－48＝13（元）<br>故選(Ｂ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910234","s":"如圖，梯形　ABCD　中，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r130.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r131.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，有一圓　O　通過　A、B、C　三點，且<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r132.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">與圓　O　相切於　A　點。若∠B＝58°，則　︵︵︵︵　的度數為何？〔110.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image12.png\" width=\"112\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["116","120","122","128"],"a":3,"e":"<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image13.png\" width=\"112\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r135.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r136.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r137.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">與圓　O　相切於　A　點<br>∴︵︵︵︵＝︵︵︵︵＝2∠B＝2×58°＝116°<br>因此，︵︵︵︵＝360°－︵︵︵︵－︵︵︵︵<br>＝360°－116°×2<br>＝128°<br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910235","s":"若坐標平面上二次函數　y＝a（x＋b）<sup>2</sup>＋c　的圖形，經過平移後可與　y＝（x＋3）<sup>2</sup>　的圖形完全疊合，則　a、b、c　的值可能為下列哪一組？〔110.會考〕","o":["a＝1，b＝0，c＝－2","a＝2，b＝6，c＝0","a＝－1，b＝－3，c＝0","a＝－2，b＝3，c＝－2"],"a":0,"e":"因為　y＝a（x＋b）<sup>2</sup>＋c　的圖形平移後可與　y＝（x＋3）<sup>2</sup>　的圖形完全疊合<br>所以　a＝1（∵開口大小及方向不變）<br>故選(Ａ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910236","s":"如圖，△ABC　中，D、E、F　三點分別在<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r138.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r139.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r140.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且四邊形　BEFD　是以<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r141.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">為對稱軸的線對稱圖形，四邊形　CFDE　是以<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r142.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">為對稱軸的線對稱圖形。若∠C＝40°，則∠DFE　的度數為何？〔110.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image14.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["65","70","75","80"],"a":3,"e":"如圖<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image15.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵四邊形　BEFD　是以<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r145.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">為對稱軸的線對稱圖形<br>∴∠1＝∠2，∠B＝∠DFE，∠4＝∠5<br>∵四邊形　CFDE　是以<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r146.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">為對稱軸的線對稱圖形<br>∴∠2＝∠3，∠5＝∠C＝40°<br>由上述可知，∠1＝∠2＝∠3<br>又∠1＋∠2＋∠3＝180°∴∠1＝∠2＝∠3＝60°<br>故∠DFE＝180°－（∠2＋∠5）<br>＝180°－（60°＋40°）<br>＝80°<br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910237","s":"已知捷立租車行有甲、乙兩個營業據點，顧客租車後當日須於營業結束前在任意一個據點還車。某日營業結束清點車輛時，發現在甲歸還的自行車比從甲出租的多　4　輛。若當日從甲出租且在甲歸還的自行車為　15　輛，從乙出租且在乙歸還的自行車為　13　輛，則關於當日從甲、乙出租的自行車數量，下列比較何者正確？〔110.會考〕","o":["從甲出租的比從乙出租的多　2　輛","從甲出租的比從乙出租的少　2　輛","從甲出租的比從乙出租的多　6　輛","從甲出租的比從乙出租的少　6　輛"],"a":1,"e":"如表<br>假設從乙出租在甲歸還的自行車為　a　輛；<br>從甲出租在乙歸還的自行車為　b　輛<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r147.svg\" class=\"blk\" width=\"319\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>則　a＋15＝（b＋15）＋4，即　a＝b＋4<br>故從甲出租的　b＋15　輛比<br>從乙出租　a＋13＝b＋17　輛少　2　輛<br>故選(Ｂ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05910238","s":"如圖，四邊形　ABCD　中，∠1、∠2、∠3　分別為∠A、∠B、∠C　的外角。判斷下列大小關係何者正確？〔110.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image16.png\" width=\"135\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["∠1＋∠3＝∠ABC＋∠D","∠1＋∠3＜∠ABC＋∠D","∠1＋∠2＋∠3＝360°","∠1＋∠2＋∠3＞360°"],"a":0,"e":"(１)∠1＋∠3＝（180°－∠BAD）＋（180°－∠BCD）<br>＝360°－（∠BAD＋∠BCD）<br>＝∠ABC＋∠D<br>(２)∵四邊形的一組外角和為　360°<br>∠1、∠2、∠3　為其中　3　個外角<br>∴∠1＋∠2＋∠3＜360°<br>故選(Ａ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910239","s":"若　a、b　為正整數，且　a×b＝2<sup>5</sup>×3<sup>2</sup>×5，則下列何者不可能為　a、b　的最大公因數？〔110.會考〕","o":["1","6","8","12"],"a":2,"e":"【解一】<br>a、b　為正整數，且　a×b＝2<sup>5</sup>×3<sup>2</sup>×5<br>(Ａ)例如：a＝2<sup>5</sup>，b＝3<sup>2</sup>×5，則（a , b）＝1<br>(Ｂ)例如：a＝（2×3）×2<sup>3</sup>，b＝（2×3）×5<br>則（a , b）＝2×3＝6<br>(Ｃ)若（a , b）＝8，則　a＝2<sup>3</sup>×m，b＝2<sup>3</sup>×n<br>其中（m , n）＝1<br>a×b＝（2<sup>3</sup>×m）×（2<sup>3</sup>×n）＝2<sup>6</sup>×m×n（不合）<br>(Ｄ)例如：a＝（2<sup>2</sup>×3）×2，b＝（2<sup>2</sup>×3）×5<br>則（a , b）＝2<sup>2</sup>×3＝12<br>故選(Ｃ)<br>【解二】<br>設　a、b　最大公因數（a , b）＝c<br>可令　a＝c×m，b＝c×n，且（m , n）＝1<br>此時　a×b＝（c×m）×（c×n）＝c<sup>2</sup>×m×n<br>∴c<sup>2</sup>　是　a×b　的因數<br>由　1<sup>2</sup>＝1，6<sup>2</sup>＝36＝2<sup>2</sup>×3<sup>2</sup>，8<sup>2</sup>＝64＝2<sup>6</sup><br>12<sup>2</sup>＝144＝2<sup>4</sup>×3<sup>2</sup>　可知<br>8<sup>2</sup>　不是　a×b　的因數<br>∴8　不可能是　a、b　的最大公因數<br>故選(Ｃ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05910240","s":"如圖，菱形　ABCD　中，E　點在<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r149.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，F　點在<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r150.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，G　點、H　點在<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r151.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r152.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r153.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r154.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">。若<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r155.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r156.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r157.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4，則下列選項中的線段，何者的長度最長？〔110.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image17.png\" width=\"119\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r159.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r160.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r161.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r162.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":0,"e":"<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image18.png\" width=\"117\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵四邊形　ABCD　是菱形<br>∴<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r164.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r165.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r166.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r167.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r168.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r169.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝4＋5＋8＝17，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r170.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r171.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(１)由<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r172.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r173.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r174.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r175.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">可知四邊形　AECH　為平行四邊形<br>故<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r176.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r177.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8（平行四邊形對邊等長）<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r178.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝17－8＝9<br>(２)在△CDH　中　∵<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r179.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r180.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r181.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r182.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r183.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r184.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4：5<br>故<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r185.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r186.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">×<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r187.svg\" width=\"36\" alt=\"附圖\">＝17×<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r188.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r189.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝7<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r190.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r191.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r192.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">×<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r193.svg\" width=\"36\" alt=\"附圖\">＝17×<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r194.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r195.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝9<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r196.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>由(１)、(２)可知，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r197.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r198.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r199.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r200.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ａ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910241","s":"小文原本計畫使用甲、乙兩臺影印機於　10：00　開始一起印製文件並持續到下午，但　10：00　時有人正在使用乙，於是他先使用甲印製，於　10：05　才開始使用乙一起印製。且到　10：15　時乙印製的總張數與甲相同，到　10：45　時甲、乙印製的總張數合計為　2100　張。若甲、乙的印製張數與印製時間皆成正比，則依照小文原本的計畫，甲、乙印製的總張數會在哪個時間達到　2100　張？〔110.會考〕","o":["10：40","10：41","10：42","10：43"],"a":2,"e":"由題意可知<br>甲從　10：00～10：15　這　15　分鐘印製的張數與乙從　10：05～10：15　這　10　分鐘印製的張數相同<br>設甲每分鐘印製　x　張，乙每分鐘印製　y　張，則　15x＝10y<br>∴x：y＝10：15＝2：3<br>令　x＝2r，y＝3r，r≠0<br>45×2r＋（45－5）×3r＝2100<br>90r＋120r＝2100，r＝10<br>可得甲、乙兩人每分鐘共印製　2r＋3r＝5r＝5×10＝50（張）<br>2100÷50＝42<br>∴原本的計畫印製張數在　10：42　達到　2100　張<br>故選(Ｃ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910242","s":"如圖，銳角三角形　ABC　中，D　點在<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r201.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，∠B＝∠BAD＝∠CAD。今欲在<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r202.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">上找一點　P，使得∠APC＝∠ADB，以下是甲、乙兩人的作法：<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image19.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(甲)作<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r204.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線交<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r205.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">於　P　點，則　P　即為所求<br>(乙)以　C　為圓心，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r206.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　長為半徑畫弧，交<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r207.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">於異於　D　點的一點　P，則　P　即為所求<br>對於甲、乙兩人的作法，下列判斷何者正確？〔110.會考〕","o":["兩人皆正確","兩人皆錯誤","甲正確，乙錯誤","甲錯誤，乙正確"],"a":0,"e":"設∠B＝∠BAD＝∠CAD＝x°<br>則∠ADB＝180°－2x°<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image20.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(甲)如圖<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image21.png\" width=\"144\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>L　是<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r210.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線交<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r211.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">於　P<br>∴<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r212.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r213.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">（中垂線性質）<br>故∠PCA＝∠CAD＝x°<br>因此，∠APC＝180°－2x°＝∠ADB<br>可知，甲的作法正確<br>(乙)如圖，由題意可知<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r214.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r215.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image22.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴∠CPD＝∠CDP（等腰三角形兩底角相等）<br>又∠APC＋∠CPD＝180°＝∠ADB＋∠CDP<br>因此，∠APC＝∠ADB<br>可知，乙的作法正確<br>故選(Ａ)","k":["110年會考"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05910243","s":"如圖，I　為△ABC　的內心，有一直線通過　I　點且分別與<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r217.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r218.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">相交於　D　點、E　點。若<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r219.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r220.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r221.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6，則　I　點到<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r222.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的距離為何？〔110.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image23.png\" width=\"117\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r224.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r225.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">","2","3"],"a":0,"e":"【解一】<br>如圖<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image24.png\" width=\"117\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵I　為△ABC　的內心<br>∴I　點到<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r227.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的距離＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r228.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r229.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r230.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>作△ADE　的高<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r231.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r232.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r233.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5<br>∴<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r234.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r235.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r236.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r237.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r238.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r239.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r240.svg\" width=\"59\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4<br>設<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r241.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r242.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r243.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝x<br>由△ADE　面積＝△ADI　面積＋△AEI　面積<br>可知<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r244.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×6×4＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r245.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×5×x＋<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r246.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×6×x，x＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r247.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ａ)<br>【解二】<br>(１)如圖，分別作　<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r248.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r249.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r250.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r251.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r252.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r253.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_image25.png\" width=\"117\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵I　為△ABC　的內心<br>∴○　I　點到<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r255.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的距離即為<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r256.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">，且<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r257.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r258.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>○<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r259.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">　平分∠BAC<br>可得<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r260.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r261.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r262.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r263.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5：6（內分比性質）<br>(２)△ADE　中<br>∵<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r264.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r265.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r266.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r267.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r268.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r269.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r270.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3（等腰三角形底邊上的高平分底邊）<br><img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r271.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r272.svg\" width=\"59\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4<br>由(１)、(２)可知，<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r273.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r274.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r275.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">×<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r276.svg\" width=\"35\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝4×<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r277.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9451c7_y110_r278.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">（平行線截比例線段）","k":["110年會考"],"d":"中","html":1}]